    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110672" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθειρ-ίαω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be lousy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				5.5
			</span></i>: esp. <i>have the morbus pedicularis, Com. A
				desp.</i><i><span class="en">
				280
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.463
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				36
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἐκ νόσου φθειριῶσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.37
				</span></i>
			; of bees, <i><span class="en">
