				15.2.13
			</span></i>; of oxen, ib.<i><span class="en">
				17.29
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθειριῶσα ἄμπελος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					7.5.8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
